{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/1425367-does-fire-resistance-apply-against-fire-based-exploits-like-hellfire","id":1425367,"title":"Does Fire resistance apply against fire based exploits like hellfire?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Demon: The Descent"],"posts":[{"date":"2020-11-21T09:21:50-08:00","id":1425367,"title":"Does Fire resistance apply against fire based exploits like hellfire?","content":"The questions i literally the title. I am just curious because I'm running a Demon campaign and I am planning on throwing a Demon antagonist at the ring. One of the players really loves using that exploit and I would like to shock him with an enemy he can't just easily burn away.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26549-perennial-memories","name":"Perennial Memories","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-11-24T08:44:57-08:00","id":1425964,"title":"","content":"I would say no. <br /> <br /> Fire immunity is more about mundane fire. While Hellfire on the other hand states <br /> <br /> &quot;The demon forces Aether through her firearms, converting<br /> the bullets into magically charged flame. The fire thus created<br /> can incinerate victims or destroy material objects, but it does<br /> not start fires \u2014 nothing touched by the Hellfire ignites&quot; <br /> <br /> So it's magically charged fire.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1540-basic","name":"Basic","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1540_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"777"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-11-25T13:32:10-08:00","id":1426173,"title":"","content":"Regardless though, if you want an antagonist who is resistant to this <b>kind </b>of fire, you can have that anyway. You are the Storyteller, so do what tells the best stories! Perhaps the antagonist even has a Demonic Form that is all Spooky Fire and therefore immune to mundane and supernatural fire (perhaps this is related to what that Demon had as a job back in their Angel days).","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Politeness is the lubricant of social intercourse.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/272-saibot","name":"saibot","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar272_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1063"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}